          "raw": "Hello,\n\nThis is an automated message from Discourse to let you know that a moderator silenced your account until January 1, 2027, 12:00am (UTC+00:00).\n\nReason: Breaking the rules\n\nYou can still read discussions, but you can’t participate in them while your account is silenced.\n\nFor additional guidance, refer to our [community guidelines](http://localhost:3042/guidelines).",
